Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:51:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] PixelOS: Add disguise device for music apps toggle

Adds a switch below the status bar lyric toggle in Display settings,
backed by persist.sys.disguise_props_for_music_app (read by
MeizuPropsUtils at Application instantiation). Disabled while the
status bar lyric switch is off. Music apps must be restarted after
toggling. Ported from PixelExperience.

Change-Id: I7449514c7dd8015d925a794a6babf40836203d4d
